#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a module for scheduling programs to run in the background. It is a "
"graphical user interface to <command>cron</command>, the &UNIX; system "
"scheduler."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je modul za planiranje programa koji se pokrecu u pozadini. To je "
"graficko korisnicko okruzenje za <command>cron</command>,  &UNIX; System "
"Sheduler."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Don't forget to tell your system to start the <filename>crond</filename> "
"cron daemon first, or the settings in this module will not work."
msgstr ""
"Ne zaboravite reci svom sistemu da započne <filename>crond</filename> cron "
"daemon prvo, ili postavke u ovom modulu neće raditi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start Up"
msgstr "Pokrenuti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start this module you will see a summarized view of existing "
"scheduled tasks and associated environment variables. If you are running as "
"the root user, you will see these items for all users on the computer as "
"well as the system scheduled tasks."
msgstr ""
"Kada započnete ovaj modul  vidjeti ćete sažeti prikaz postojećih planiranih "
"zadataka i povezane varijable okoline. Ako koristite kao root korisnik, "
"vidjet ćete ove stavke za sve korisnike na kompjuteru, kao i zadatke koje je "
"sistem planirao."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>start up</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>pokretanje</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>start up</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>pokretanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheduled Tasks"
msgstr "Raspoređeni zadaci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scheduled tasks appear under a <guilabel>Tasks</guilabel> list. For each "
"scheduled task, the following items are displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Scheduled Tasks s pojavljuju ispod <guilabel>Tasks</guilabel>  liste.  Za "
"svaki <guilabel>Tasks</guilabel>  prikazuju se stavke:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "Planiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this column either \"@reboot\" for task schedules at boot or the crontab "
"entry is displayed."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj kolumni ili \"@reboot\" za planiranje zadataka pri pokretanju sistema "
"ili crontab unos  se prikazuje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:101 index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Naredba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Program file and parameters."
msgstr "Programski fajl i parametri."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:105 index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106 index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enabled or Disabled."
msgstr "Omogućen ili onemogućen."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "A description for the task, such as its purpose."
msgstr "Opis zadatka, kao sto je njegova svrha."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheduling Details"
msgstr "Detalji planiranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "Natural language description of scheduled task."
msgstr "Prirodni jezički opis planiranih zadataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "Varijable okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Environment variables appear in the <guilabel>Environment Variables</"
"guilabel> list. For each environment variable, the following are displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Environment Variables se pojavljuju u <guilabel>Environment Variables</"
"guilabel> listi. Za svaku enviroment varijablu prikazuje se sljedece:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:131 index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Varijabla"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "Variable name."
msgstr "Ime varijable."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:135 index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Vrijednost"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Variable value."
msgstr "Vrijednost varijable."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:143 index.docbook:181 index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Comment"
msgstr "Komentar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Natural language description of variable."
msgstr "Prirodni jezicki opis varijable."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Environment variables appearing here will override any existing environment "
"variable for all scheduled tasks."
msgstr ""
"Varijable okruženja koje se pojavljuju ovdje će preuzeti postojeće varijable "
"okruženja za sve planirane zadatke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Scheduled Tasks"
msgstr "Dodavanje rasporeda zadataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new scheduled task, click the <guibutton>New Task...</guibutton> "
"button. Alternatively, you can select this action from the "
"<mousebutton>right</mousebutton> mouse button context menu."
msgstr ""
"Da kreirate novi  raspored zadataka klinite na <guibutton>Novi zadatak...</"
"guibutton> dugme. Alternativno mozete izabrati ovu akciju  iz "
"<mousebutton>desnog</mousebutton>  dugmeta na misu i njgovog kontekstnog "
"menija"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Edit Task Dialog"
msgstr "DIjalog za uređivanje zadataka"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Edit Task</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr "<guilabel>Uredi zadatak</guilabel> dijalog."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Edit Task</guilabel> dialog"
msgstr "<guilabel>Uredi zadatakk</guilabel> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the program. You can specify either a relative path or "
"absolute path. If you want to look up the program, click <guiicon>Browse</"
"guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ime programa.Možete odrediti relativnu putanju ili apsolutni put. "
"Ako želite pogledati program, kliknite na <guiicon> Traži </guiicon>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a description of the task to schedule."
msgstr "Unesite opis zadatka koji planirate."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable this task"
msgstr "Omogucite zadatak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "To enable or disable the task, select or de-select this button."
msgstr ""
"Da omogućite ili onemogućite zadatak, označite ili odznačite ovo dugme."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run at system bootup"
msgstr "Pokrenuite pri pokretanju sistema"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this button to run the task at system bootup."
msgstr "Provjerite ovaj gumb za pokretanje zadatka pri pokretanju sistema."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run every day"
msgstr "Pokrecite svaki dan"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you want to schedule the task to run daily, select this button."
msgstr ""
"Ako zelite da zakazete da se zadaci obavljauju svakodnevno, pritisnite ovo "
"dugme."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Months"
msgstr "Mjeseci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the months during which the task is to be scheduled."
msgstr "Odaberite mjesece u kojima je zadatak planiran."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Dani u mjesecu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the days of the month on which the task is to be scheduled."
msgstr "Odaberite dane u mjesecu u kojima je zadatak planiran."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Dani u sedmici"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the days of the week on which the task is to be scheduled."
msgstr "Odaberite dane u sedmici u kojima je zadatak planiran."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hours"
msgstr "Sati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the hours on which the task is to be scheduled."
msgstr "Odaberite sate u kojima je zadatak planiran."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minutes"
msgstr "Minute"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the minute at which the task is to be scheduled. <command>cron</"
"command> does not support scheduling tasks at smaller than one minute "
"intervals."
msgstr "Odaberite minute u kojima je zadatak planiran."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:236 index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>OK</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>U redu</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Completes the creation of this task."
msgstr "Zavrsava kreiranje ovog taska."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:241 index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Zatvori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancels the creation of this task."
msgstr "Zatvori kreiranje ovog zadatka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select both days of the month, and days of the week, the task will "
"run when either condition is met. For instance, if you select the 1st and "
"15th, and select Sunday, the program will be run every 1st and 15th of the "
"selected months (regardless of day of week) as well as every Sunday of the "
"selected months (regardless of day of the month)."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete oba dana u mjesecu, i dane u sedmici, zadatak će se pokrenuti "
"kada se sretne sa nekim od tih stanja. Na primjer, ako odaberete 1. i 15., i "
"odaberite Nedjelja, program će se pokrenuti svakog 1. i 15. odabranog "
"mjeseca (bez obzira na dan u sedmici), kao i svake nedjelje odabranog "
"mjeseca (bez obzira na dan u mjesecu)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scheduled task is not actually set up until the <filename>crontab</"
"filename> has been saved."
msgstr ""
"Planirani zadatak zapravo nije postavljen dok ga <filename>crontab</"
"filename> nije snimio."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Scheduled Tasks"
msgstr "Upravljanje raspoređenim zadacima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with creating new tasks, changes to tasks will not actually be made until "
"the <filename>crontab</filename> is saved."
msgstr ""
"Kao i kod keiranja novih zadataka, promjene na zadacima nece biti snimljene "
"dok ih  <filename>crontab</filename> ne snimi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the buttons at the right of the task list to modify, delete, print or "
"run a selected task now. You reach all these actions from the context menu "
"as well. Additionally the context menu provides actions to cut, copy and "
"paste tasks."
msgstr ""
"Koristite dugmas s desne strane da modifikujete, brišete, printate ili "
"pokrećete selektovani zadatak sada. Do svih ovih radnji dođete iz "
"kontekstnog menija.  Pored toga kontekst meni daje akcije za rezanje,"
"kopiranje i  naljepljivanje zadataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Environment Variables"
msgstr "Dodavanje Environment Variabli"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new environment variable, click the <guibutton>New Variable...</"
"guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Da kreirate okolisnu varijablu kliknite <guibutton>New Variable...</"
"guibutton>  dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use the <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> mouse button "
"menu to choose this action."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, mozete koristiti <mousebutton>desnu</mousebutton>tipku miša "
"koja pokreće meni za ovu akciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Edit Variable dialog"
msgstr "Dijalog za izmjenu varijable"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo><guilabel>Edit Variable</guilabel> dialog.</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo><guilabel>Uredi varijablu</guilabel> dijalog.</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase><guilabel>Edit Variable</guilabel> dialog.</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase><guilabel>Uredi varijablu</guilabel> dijalog.</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the environment variable name. You can use the drop down list box to "
"select from the most common environment variables used by scheduled tasks. "
"Those include:"
msgstr ""
"Unesite ime varijable okruženja. Mozete koristi padajuću listu da odaberete "
"jednu od najčešćih varijabli okruženja koje koristi planirani zadatak. To "
"uključuje:"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "HOME"
msgstr "HOME"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "To be used instead of the default user's home folder."
msgstr "Koristi se umjesto podrazumijevanog početnog korisničkog foldera."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "MAILTO"
msgstr "MAILTO"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To send email output to an email address other than the user's default email "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Za slanje izlaznog email na email adrese koje nisu podrazumijevane "
"korisnikove adrese."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "PATH"
msgstr "PATH"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "To be used to search folders for program files."
msgstr "Koristi se da pretrazuje foldere u fajlovima."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "SHELL"
msgstr "SHELL"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "To be used instead of the user's default value."
msgstr "Da bi se koristio umjesto podrazumjevane korisnicke vrijednosti."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid "LD_CONFIG_PATH"
msgstr "LD_CONFIG_PATH"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The location of dynamic libraries. This allows cron jobs to execute "
"applications which have libraries they need to run installed outside the "
"system library path."
msgstr ""
"Lokacija dinamickih biblioteka. Ovo dopusta cron jobs da izvrsi  aplikacije "
"koje imaju biblioteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter the environment variable value."
msgstr "Unesite vrijednost varijable okruženja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a description for the environment variable, such as its purpose."
msgstr "Unesite opis za varijablu okruženja, kao je sto njega svrha."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable this variable"
msgstr "Omogući ovu varijablu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "To enable or disable the variable, select or de-select this button."
msgstr ""
"Da omogućite ili onemogućite ovu varijablu, selektujte ili deselektujte ovo "
"dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "Completes the setting of this variable."
msgstr "Završava podešenja za ovu varijablu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancels the setting of this variable."
msgstr "Otkazuje podešenja za ovu varijablu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The environment variable is not actually set up until the <filename>crontab</"
"filename> has been saved."
msgstr ""
"Varijabla okruženja zapravno nije postavljena dok se <filename>crontab</"
"filename> ne sačuva."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Environment Variables"
msgstr "Upravljanje varijablama okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with creating new variables, changes to variables will not actually be "
"made until the <filename>crontab</filename> is saved."
msgstr ""
"Kao i kod kreiranja novih varijabli, promjene u varijabli se zapravo nece "
"desiti sve dok  <filename>crontab</filename> se ne snimi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the buttons at the right of the variable list to modify or delete a "
"selected variable. You reach all these actions from the context menu as "
"well. Additionally the context menu provides actions to cut, copy and paste "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"Koristite dugmad desno od liste varijabli da modifikujete, brišete, printate "
"ili pokrećete selektovanu varijablu.Do svih ovih radnji dođete iz "
"kontekstnog menija.  Pored toga kontekst meni daje akcije za isijecanje,"
"kopiranje i  umetanje varijabli."
